{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10292260","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10292260","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1029226001:0":{"text":"你们这些愚蠢的逃兵！难道就一点也不为自己的行为感到羞愧吗？","source_cn":"你们这些愚蠢的逃兵！难道就一点也不为自己的行为感到羞愧吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C017E0806125206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029226002:0":{"text":"什、什么！沙奎尔怎么会在这里……难道我们的计划暴露了？是谁露了马脚？","source_cn":"什、什么！沙奎尔怎么会在这里……难道我们的计划暴露了？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE91B537D2CE6229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029226003:2":{"text":"不可能。先别忙着互相责怪，还是想想怎么从沙奎尔眼皮下面逃跑吧……","source_cn":"不可能。先别忙着互相责怪，还是想想怎么从沙奎尔眼皮下面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC350DAEAA6C02D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029226004:0":{"text":"逃跑？哼，既然已经被我找到了，你们一个都别想逃！","source_cn":"逃跑？哼，既然已经被我找到了，你们一个都别想逃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F68AACD038A9640","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙奎尔":{"text":"沙奎尔","source":"沙奎尔","status":"source"},"speaker:愤怒的盗宝贼":{"text":"愤怒的盗宝贼","source":"愤怒的盗宝贼","status":"source"},"speaker:烦躁的盗宝贼":{"text":"烦躁的盗宝贼","source":"烦躁的盗宝贼","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}